+
+// AppleTalk phase, Task 8: the BROWSER end-to-end fixture. args[0] is the
+// NBP type to look up; an optional args[1] selects the two-argument
+// find(type, zone) overload instead of the one-argument form (which
+// supplies "*" at the lowering seam). One `found` line per match, then
+// `done` -- which always arrives, even with no matches (spec %4.3), and
+// is what makes the program exit on its own.
