+// it returns with `out` already filled, no event and no pump pass. On a
+// routerless network (every host lane run, and every LocalTalk one) the
+// answer is the single zone "*", so a program never special-cases having
+// no router (spec %4.3). tests/atalk/zones.sh asserts exactly "zones 1 *".
